    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Introduction</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470300/extras/e404a6165905775257b34d93f5a69606.poster.avif?t=1734650873\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470300/extras/e404a6165905775257b34d93f5a69606.webm?t=1734650873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470300/extras/e404a6165905775257b34d93f5a69606.mp4?t=1734650873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> In the year 2XXX, on the quiet outskirts of Akihabara, a new hookah lounge called &quot;Hookah Haze&quot; opens its doors.<br> <br> As the new manager, Toru Sumiki, you will engage in heartfelt conversations with a variety of unique and colorful patrons, gradually discovering changes within your own heart. <br> Enjoy serene and tranquil nights while immersing yourself in these captivating interactions.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Game Features</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470300/extras/b1334302ad1cf99f25e9420420308e10.poster.avif?t=1734650873\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470300/extras/b1334302ad1cf99f25e9420420308e10.webm?t=1734650873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470300/extras/b1334302ad1cf99f25e9420420308e10.mp4?t=1734650873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> \u30fb Experience the individual stories of each heroine, with a total gameplay time of around 10 hours.<br> \u30fbThe heroines visiting the lounge will change based on the recommended recipes shared on social media.<br> \u30fbEach heroine's story has multiple endings influenced by the choices made throughout the game.<br> \u30fbAchieve the happy endings for all three heroines to unlock new endings and discover more about the story.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Story</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470300/extras/bf619503323ed865d25a52ff5bbcc135.poster.avif?t=1734650873\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470300/extras/bf619503323ed865d25a52ff5bbcc135.webm?t=1734650873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470300/extras/bf619503323ed865d25a52ff5bbcc135.mp4?t=1734650873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>&quot;Anything you want to try doing?&quot;<br>The protagonist, Toru Sumiki, loses the will to live after being diagnosed with a fatal illness.<br>Toru's doctor insists they should make the most of the little time they have left,<br>and they sign on as a temporary manager of a hookah lounge.<br><br>Through this new job, Toru meets three very unusual girls.<br>Although cheerful at a glance, they're battling with work problems or past trauma,<br>searching for a place to belong.<br>As Toru begins to bond with them through hookah,<br>what will they find once the girls fully open up?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Characters</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470300/extras/6dee7c77d3123ec6a4015cced3240127.poster.avif?t=1734650873\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470300/extras/6dee7c77d3123ec6a4015cced3240127.webp?t=1734650873\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br><strong>Amu Aigami</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Don't skimp on praise for me, I deserve it!&quot;</h2><br>Birthday: November 11. 23 years old. Blood type: B.<br>Novelty cafe employee at Akihabara. Thirsty for attention, loves to be spoiled. Absolutely loves herself.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470300/extras/ba0ab41e93fe9e4c6c01d7a5437c8c5f.poster.avif?t=1734650873\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470300/extras/ba0ab41e93fe9e4c6c01d7a5437c8c5f.webp?t=1734650873\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br><strong>Meigetsuin Kokoro</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Ever thought being alive was overrated?&quot;</h2><br>Birthday: June 21. 27 years old. Blood type: A.<br>Store clerk.<br>Polite, intelligent and usually optimistic, but hides past trauma.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470300/extras/282ac6035a55a416db44d501436d1f71.poster.avif?t=1734650873\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470300/extras/282ac6035a55a416db44d501436d1f71.webp?t=1734650873\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br><strong>Kurumi Komori</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Nuts!&quot;</h2><br>Birthday: July 22. 21 years old. Blood type: B.<br>A doll-maker employed by a big business.<br>Comes off as willful. Not a great communicator.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470300/extras/decb7b92eb8dded1b43d73656c9707ab.poster.avif?t=1734650873\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470300/extras/decb7b92eb8dded1b43d73656c9707ab.webp?t=1734650873\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br><strong>Toru Sumiki</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;I'd like to connect with someone through my interests.&quot;</h2><br>25 years old. Blood type: AB<br>Hookah Haze's temporary manager.<br>Has a tendency to give up on their own desires and put others before themself.<br>Loves hookah and fish tanks.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6DEMO</h2> Enjoy a unique story not found in the main game.<br> Live through two days in the hookah lounge, with different outcomes based on the patrons who visit. <br> Replay the game to uncover all the different stories.<br> \u203bNote: Progress from the demo will not carry over to the full version.<br> \u203bIn the full version, the &quot;ANOTHER DAY&quot; feature will allow you to experience the same content as the DEMO.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6Staff</h2>Planning and development: ACQUIRE<br>Sales: ANIPLEX<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470300/extras/c5388cccabe0381d065e5b10cf4b4608.poster.avif?t=1734650873\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470300/extras/c5388cccabe0381d065e5b10cf4b4608.webm?t=1734650873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
